## 🟡 Low Severity / Best Practice Issues

### 8. No Error Handling Middleware (OWASP A09:2021 – Security Logging & Monitoring Failures)

**Problem:** No global error handler means unhandled errors could leak stack traces to the client in development, or crash the server.

**Recommendation:**
```javascript
// Global error handler (place AFTER all routes)
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  console.error(`[${new Date().toISOString()}] Error:`, err.message);
