│  AWS Secrets Manager / Vault / GCP SM       │
│            ↓                                │
│  IAM role-based access (no static keys)     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Environment variables should contain ONLY:
  - VAULT_ADDR or SECRET_ARN (pointer to secrets manager)
  - NODE_ENV
  - PORT
  - Non-sensitive configuration
```

